    "text": "The value of $r$ for which\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n{ }^{20} C_{r}{ }^{20} C_{0}+{ }^{20} C_{r-1}{ }^{20} C_{1}+{ }^{20} C_{r-2}{ }^{20} C_{2}+\\ldots+{ }^{20} C_{0}{ }^{20} C_{r}\r\n\r\n$$ is maximum, is:",
