  "solution": {
    "text": "Consider the expression ${ }^{20} C_{r}{ }^{20} C_{0}+{ }^{20} C_{r-1}{ }^{20} C_{1}$ $+{ }^{20} C_{r-2}{ }^{20} C_{2}+\\ldots+{ }^{20} C_{0} \\cdot{ }^{20} C_{r}$\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFor maximum value of above expression $r$ should be equal to 20 .\r\n\r\nas\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n{ }^{20} C_{20} \\cdot{ }^{20} C_{0}+{ }^{20} C_{19} \\cdot{ }^{20} C_{1}+\\ldots+{ }^{20} C_{20} \\cdot{ }^{20} C_{0} \\\\\r\n\r\n=\\left({ }^{20} C_{0}\\right)^{2}+\\left({ }^{20} C_{1}\\right)^{2}+\\cdots+\\left({ }^{20} C_{20}\\right)^{2}={ }^{40} C_{20}\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\nWhich is the maximum value of the expression, So, $r=20$.",
